{"id":"d140fd398f5f1e6b","group":"58","path":"58/batch09/58-thm-covering-lemmas.md","title":"Covering Lemmas","display":"thm-covering-lemmas — Covering Lemmas","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-thm-covering-lemmas","aliases":["58-thm-covering-lemmas"],"display":"thm-covering-lemmas — Covering Lemmas","depends_on":["[[../batch14/58-df-zero-sharp.md]]","[[58-df-cardinal]]","[[58-df-ordinal]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-thm-covering-lemmas"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-thm-covering-lemmas</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-covering-lemmas — Covering Lemmas"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"950549c09248b205\" href=\"?note=950549c09248b205\" title=\"../batch14/58-df-zero-sharp.md\">../batch14/58-df-zero-sharp.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"5fb1c2241d1943d1\" href=\"?note=5fb1c2241d1943d1\" title=\"58-df-cardinal\">58-df-cardinal</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"5582a281f15a33c2\" href=\"?note=5582a281f15a33c2\" title=\"58-df-ordinal\">58-df-ordinal</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"L\">\\(L\\)</span> is the constructible universe and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZeroSharpExists}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{ZeroSharpExists}_S\\)</span> is the proposition from <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"950549c09248b205\" href=\"?note=950549c09248b205\" title=\"../batch14/58-df-zero-sharp.md\">../batch14/58-df-zero-sharp.md</a></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Ordinal}\">\\(\\mathrm{Ordinal}\\)</span> is the set predicate from <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"5582a281f15a33c2\" href=\"?note=5582a281f15a33c2\" title=\"58-df-ordinal\">58-df-ordinal</a></li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}covering\\text{-}lemmas} \\vdash \\neg\\mathrm{ZeroSharpExists}_S\\to\\forall X\\in V\\;\\Bigl(\\forall\\xi\\in X\\;\\mathrm{Ordinal}(\\xi)\\land\\lvert X\\rvert&gt;\\aleph_0\\to\\exists Y\\in L\\;(X\\subseteq Y\\land\\lvert Y\\rvert=\\lvert X\\rvert)\\Bigr)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}covering\\text{-}lemmas} \\vdash \\neg\\mathrm{ZeroSharpExists}_S\\to\\forall X\\in V\\;\\Bigl(\\forall\\xi\\in X\\;\\mathrm{Ordinal}(\\xi)\\land\\lvert X\\rvert&gt;\\aleph_0\\to\\exists Y\\in L\\;(X\\subseteq Y\\land\\lvert Y\\rvert=\\lvert X\\rvert)\\Bigr)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Jensen's covering lemma says that, if <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"0^\\#\">\\(0^\\#\\)</span> does not exist, uncountable sets of ordinals are covered by constructible sets of the same cardinality; in this sense <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"V\">\\(V\\)</span> is cardinally close to <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"L\">\\(L\\)</span>.</li>\n<li>Core-model covering theorems require additional hypotheses and must not be inferred from this <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"L\">\\(L\\)</span>-specific statement alone.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch14/58-df-zero-sharp.md","status":"resolved","id":"950549c09248b205","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch14/58-df-zero-sharp.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-cardinal","status":"resolved","id":"5fb1c2241d1943d1","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-cardinal]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-ordinal","status":"resolved","id":"5582a281f15a33c2","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-ordinal]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch14/58-df-zero-sharp.md","status":"resolved","id":"950549c09248b205","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$L$ is the constructible universe and $\\mathrm{ZeroSharpExists}_S$ is the proposition from [[../batch14/58-df-zero-sharp.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-ordinal","status":"resolved","id":"5582a281f15a33c2","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Ordinal}$ is the set predicate from [[58-df-ordinal]]","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"L","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ZeroSharpExists}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Ordinal}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}covering\\text{-}lemmas} \\vdash \\neg\\mathrm{ZeroSharpExists}_S\\to\\forall X\\in V\\;\\Bigl(\\forall\\xi\\in X\\;\\mathrm{Ordinal}(\\xi)\\land\\lvert X\\rvert>\\aleph_0\\to\\exists Y\\in L\\;(X\\subseteq Y\\land\\lvert Y\\rvert=\\lvert X\\rvert)\\Bigr)","display":true},{"tex":"0^\\#","display":false},{"tex":"V","display":false},{"tex":"L","display":false},{"tex":"L","display":false}],"bytes":1148,"backlinks":[{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-4103","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch09/58-thm-covering-lemmas.md|58-thm-covering-lemmas]]（batch09）"}],"outgoing":["950549c09248b205","5fb1c2241d1943d1","5582a281f15a33c2"]}